---
import Notice from "../../components/Notice.astro";
import PageIntro from "../../components/PageIntro.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Correlius"
  description="Preview privacy status for the Correlius public-site implementation."
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    title="Collect less. Explain what remains."
    lead="The Correlius privacy design minimizes personal information and keeps public measurement separate from partner access."
  />

  <section class="section section-paper">
    <div class="shell section-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Current preview</p>
        <h2>No advertising trackers or visitor profiles.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Correlius does not use advertising trackers, analytics cookies, session replay,
          visitor profiles, or client-side audience analytics. This static preview does not
          submit personal information or connect public visits to protected partner activity.
        </p>
        <p>
          Cloudflare hosts and protects this site. Like any web host, it processes ordinary
          request and security information such as IP address, request headers, requested path,
          and security events. Correlius uses aggregate edge traffic for routine operations and
          may review limited security information when investigating abuse or failure. It does
          not use ordinary public-visit data to identify or profile visitors.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before the request form is enabled, the final notice will identify the fields,
          purpose, providers, retention behavior, and monitored privacy contact that apply.
        </p>
        <h3>Planned request handling</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Name, email, affiliation, collaboration type, and a short message are emailed only to Brian’s verified destination for manual review.</li>
          <li>A keyed digest of the normalized email—not the address itself—is kept in Cloudflare KV for 24 hours to suppress recent duplicates.</li>
          <li>Cloudflare Turnstile loads only when submission is attempted, verifies the request, and aggregate outcomes contain no applicant identity or message.</li>
          <li>The applicant receives an on-page receipt after accepted delivery; no applicant confirmation email is sent.</li>
          <li>The request cannot create an account, change the approved-email list, or grant access.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell content-stack">
      <Notice title="Policy approval still required">
        <p>
          This page describes the implementation preview and is not the final privacy
          policy. An effective date and owner-approved contact must be present before any
          personal-data form is released.
        </p>
      </Notice>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
